{"5426010":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"We Have a Gnome Problem","steam_appid":5426010,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5426010\/extras\/d2d287ea5575da3dac2329445e372d2f.poster.avif?t=1793642177\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5426010\/extras\/d2d287ea5575da3dac2329445e372d2f.webm?t=1793642177\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5426010\/extras\/d2d287ea5575da3dac2329445e372d2f.mp4?t=1793642177\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It was a quiet night at the toy shop. Then every gnome on every shelf decided to make a run for it.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now the aisles are a waddling, giggling mess, and it's up to you to put things right.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5426010\/extras\/98fa331120b33570d524693f3435adc1.avif?t=1793642177\" width=1232 height=150 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5426010\/extras\/8d6d2cc95a78ea04e8c24b8d23c650f4.poster.avif?t=1793642177\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5426010\/extras\/8d6d2cc95a78ea04e8c24b8d23c650f4.webm?t=1793642177\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5426010\/extras\/8d6d2cc95a78ea04e8c24b8d23c650f4.mp4?t=1793642177\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sneak up on a gnome, grab it and carry it to its shelf. Every kind has its own row, and the right sign lights up while you hold one. A green ghost shows exactly where it will sit. Pop. Done. Next!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5426010\/extras\/4569fdfcaf184a387f6e6853f161733f.avif?t=1793642177\" width=1232 height=150 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Knights, chefs, astronauts, mummies, cowboys, octopuses... The shop stocks a ridiculous number of different gnomes across themed sections, and each one belongs in exactly one place.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5426010\/extras\/9b955ec1fbda729de5a094171dcd9561.poster.avif?t=1793642177\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5426010\/extras\/9b955ec1fbda729de5a094171dcd9561.webm?t=1793642177\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5426010\/extras\/9b955ec1fbda729de5a094171dcd9561.mp4?t=1793642177\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wrong shelf? It'll let you know.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5426010\/extras\/0247f5493805b2d7b109b8b0b0cd8ab2.avif?t=1793642177\" width=1232 height=150 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5426010\/extras\/8bb96558b7055c37b5cb9b3379cd61fd.poster.avif?t=1793642177\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5426010\/extras\/8bb96558b7055c37b5cb9b3379cd61fd.webm?t=1793642177\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5426010\/extras\/8bb96558b7055c37b5cb9b3379cd61fd.mp4?t=1793642177\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not in the mood to walk? Throw them. Gnomes bounce, tumble and see stars, and a dizzy gnome is an easy gnome.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5426010\/extras\/256334d58ee03af7e98d50d574798e3e.avif?t=1793642177\" width=1232 height=150 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fill your collection album, track down the rare Legendary gnomes hiding in the crowd, and ring the gnome bell when the last few stragglers won't come quietly.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5426010\/extras\/01ce1743d6dbad49161182e094d20ebb.poster.avif?t=1793642177\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5426010\/extras\/01ce1743d6dbad49161182e094d20ebb.webm?t=1793642177\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5426010\/extras\/01ce1743d6dbad49161182e094d20ebb.mp4?t=1793642177\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5426010\/extras\/5692d35d570d6c421798a38f8cd16272.avif?t=1793642177\" width=1232 height=150 \/><\/span><\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A cozy, chaotic tidy-up with squishy ragdoll physics<br><\/li><li>A huge crowd of hand-designed gnomes in themed sections<br><\/li><li>Collection album, achievements and seasonal leaderboards<br><\/li><li>Full controller support, Steam Deck friendly<br><\/li><li>Play at your own pace: your shop saves as you go<br><\/li><li>Available in 10 languages<\/li><\/ul>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5426010\/extras\/d2d287ea5575da3dac2329445e372d2f.poster.avif?t=1793642177\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5426010\/extras\/d2d287ea5575da3dac2329445e372d2f.webm?t=1793642177\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5426010\/extras\/d2d287ea5575da3dac2329445e372d2f.mp4?t=1793642177\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It was a quiet night at the toy shop. Then every gnome on every shelf decided to make a run for it.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now the aisles are a waddling, giggling mess, and it's up to you to put things right.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5426010\/extras\/98fa331120b33570d524693f3435adc1.avif?t=1793642177\" width=1232 height=150 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5426010\/extras\/8d6d2cc95a78ea04e8c24b8d23c650f4.poster.avif?t=1793642177\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5426010\/extras\/8d6d2cc95a78ea04e8c24b8d23c650f4.webm?t=1793642177\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5426010\/extras\/8d6d2cc95a78ea04e8c24b8d23c650f4.mp4?t=1793642177\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sneak up on a gnome, grab it and carry it to its shelf. Every kind has its own row, and the right sign lights up while you hold one. A green ghost shows exactly where it will sit. Pop. Done. Next!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5426010\/extras\/4569fdfcaf184a387f6e6853f161733f.avif?t=1793642177\" width=1232 height=150 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Knights, chefs, astronauts, mummies, cowboys, octopuses... The shop stocks a ridiculous number of different gnomes across themed sections, and each one belongs in exactly one place.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5426010\/extras\/9b955ec1fbda729de5a094171dcd9561.poster.avif?t=1793642177\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5426010\/extras\/9b955ec1fbda729de5a094171dcd9561.webm?t=1793642177\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5426010\/extras\/9b955ec1fbda729de5a094171dcd9561.mp4?t=1793642177\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wrong shelf? It'll let you know.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5426010\/extras\/0247f5493805b2d7b109b8b0b0cd8ab2.avif?t=1793642177\" width=1232 height=150 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5426010\/extras\/8bb96558b7055c37b5cb9b3379cd61fd.poster.avif?t=1793642177\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5426010\/extras\/8bb96558b7055c37b5cb9b3379cd61fd.webm?t=1793642177\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5426010\/extras\/8bb96558b7055c37b5cb9b3379cd61fd.mp4?t=1793642177\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not in the mood to walk? Throw them. Gnomes bounce, tumble and see stars, and a dizzy gnome is an easy gnome.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5426010\/extras\/256334d58ee03af7e98d50d574798e3e.avif?t=1793642177\" width=1232 height=150 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fill your collection album, track down the rare Legendary gnomes hiding in the crowd, and ring the gnome bell when the last few stragglers won't come quietly.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5426010\/extras\/01ce1743d6dbad49161182e094d20ebb.poster.avif?t=1793642177\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5426010\/extras\/01ce1743d6dbad49161182e094d20ebb.webm?t=1793642177\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5426010\/extras\/01ce1743d6dbad49161182e094d20ebb.mp4?t=1793642177\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5426010\/extras\/5692d35d570d6c421798a38f8cd16272.avif?t=1793642177\" width=1232 height=150 \/><\/span><\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A cozy, chaotic tidy-up with squishy ragdoll physics<br><\/li><li>A huge crowd of hand-designed gnomes in themed sections<br><\/li><li>Collection album, achievements and seasonal leaderboards<br><\/li><li>Full controller support, Steam Deck friendly<br><\/li><li>Play at your own pace: your shop saves as you go<br><\/li><li>Available in 10 languages<\/li><\/ul>","short_description":"Your toy shop has a gnome problem. In this cozy first-person tidying game, catch a whole shopful of runaway gnomes, toss the troublemakers and put every single one back on its proper shelf.","supported_languages":"English, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Simplified Chinese, Portuguese - Brazil, Japanese, Korean, Russian, Turkish","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5426010\/ee90b9560679f433c39e4a9217d4291d2b79e7ac\/header.jpg?t=1793642177","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5426010\/9914f535d87ad2e826dd8abe8eefd547e122fbeb\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1793642177","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5426010\/9914f535d87ad2e826dd8abe8eefd547e122fbeb\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1793642177","website":"https:\/\/pixelifact.com","pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br><\/li><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10 (64-bit)<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel Core i5-4460 \/ AMD Ryzen 3 1200<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 8 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 960 \/ AMD Radeon RX 470 (2 GB VRAM, DirectX 11 with compute shaders)<br><\/li><li><strong>DirectX:<\/strong> Version 11<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 500 MB available space<br><\/li><li><strong>Additional Notes:<\/strong> Runs at 1080p on the Low preset. The game draws thousands of gnomes at once, so the graphics card matters more than the processor.<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br><\/li><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10 \/ 11 (64-bit)<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel Core i5-8400 \/ AMD Ryzen 5 2600<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 16 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1660 \/ AMD Radeon RX 5600 XT (6 GB VRAM)<br><\/li><li><strong>DirectX:<\/strong> Version 11<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 500 MB available space<br><\/li><li><strong>Additional Notes:<\/strong> 1440p on the High preset.<\/li><\/ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> macOS 12 Monterey<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Apple M1 or Intel Core i5 (2017 or newer)<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 8 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> Apple M1 \/ AMD Radeon Pro 560 (Metal)<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 500 MB available space<br><\/li><li><strong>Additional Notes:<\/strong> Runs at 1080p on the Low preset. The game draws thousands of gnomes at once, so the graphics chip matters more than the processor.<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> macOS 13 Ventura or newer<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Apple M1 Pro \/ M2 or newer<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 16 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> Apple M1 Pro \/ M2 or newer (Metal)<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 500 MB available space<br><\/li><li><strong>Additional Notes:<\/strong> 1440p on the High preset.<\/li><\/ul>"},"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_u